</node>
<node id="&quot;人的具体劳动&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the labor performed by humans, which is a factor in the production process and the creation of value."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d46c22c1829ce5c303d173ac88e54caf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;新商品&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"New goods produced as a result of the labor process, embodying the value created by human labor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d46c22c1829ce5c303d173ac88e54caf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;人的必要劳动&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The necessary labor of workers, which is the labor required to produce the value of their own labor power."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d46c22c1829ce5c303d173ac88e54caf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;劳动力的价值&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The value of labor power, which is the cost of the necessary labor to reproduce the worker's labor power."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d46c22c1829ce5c303d173ac88e54caf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;个别劳动时间&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The time taken by a single worker to produce a commodity, which can vary from the socially necessary labor time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d46c22c1829ce5c303d173ac88e54caf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;超额剩余价值&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The additional surplus value produced by a capitalist through the application of more efficient methods of production than the average in the industry."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d46c22c1829ce5c303d173ac88e54caf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;资本的有机构成&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The organic composition of capital, which is the ratio of constant capital to variable capital in the total capital of a capitalist."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d46c22c1829ce5c303d173ac88e54caf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;价值评价&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"价值评价是对客观价值关系的主观反映，具有去客体的价值关系为认识对象的特点。"&lt;SEP&gt;"价值评价是对客观价值关系的主观反映，是认识对象，与评价结果直接联系，依赖于相关的识性认识。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-deacddec126d0d0961d98e274841fd63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f34069ac08b1c4bc66f348fd5d0391fa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;客观价值关系&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"客观价值关系是评价的对象，是价值评价的基础和出发点。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f34069ac08b1c4bc66f348fd5d0391fa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;评价结果&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"评价结果是价值评价的输出，与评价有着直接联系，其正确与否依赖于相关的识性认识。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f34069ac08b1c4bc66f348fd5d0391fa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;价值观&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"价值观是人们关于价值本质的认识以及对人和事物的评价标准、评价原则和评价方法的体系。"&lt;SEP&gt;"价值观是人们关于价值本质的认识以及对人和事物的评价标准、评价原则和评价方法的观点体系。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-deacddec126d0d0961d98e274841fd63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f34069ac08b1c4bc66f348fd5d0391fa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;核心价值观&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"核心价值观是价值观中最重要的部分，是人们共同认同并遵循的基本价值理念。"&lt;SEP&gt;"核心价值观是民族与国家最持久、最深层的力量，是民族精神的支柱。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-deacddec126d0d0961d98e274841fd63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f34069ac08b1c4bc66f348fd5d0391fa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;真理与价值&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"真理与价值在实践中的辨证统一，是实践活动受真理尺度和价值尺度制约的体现。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f34069ac08b1c4bc66f348fd5d0391fa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;实践活动&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"实践活动是人们改造客观世界和主观世界的实际行为，受真理尺度和价值尺度的制约。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f34069ac08b1c4bc66f348fd5d0391fa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;真理尺度&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
