</node>
<node id="&quot;道德&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Morality refers to the principles of right and wrong that govern the behavior of individuals and groups."&lt;SEP&gt;"道德是社会意识的一种形式，指人们关于行为规范和价值判断的思想观念。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-41183860ecf8e9826db112f1097e234e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f34069ac08b1c4bc66f348fd5d0391fa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;宗教&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Religion is a set of beliefs and practices concerning the supernatural, often involving rituals and a deity or deities."&lt;SEP&gt;"宗教是社会意识的一种形式，指人们关于神灵和信仰的思想观念。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-41183860ecf8e9826db112f1097e234e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f34069ac08b1c4bc66f348fd5d0391fa</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;艺术&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Art is the expression or application of human creative skill and imagination, typically in a visual form such as painting or sculpture, or in performances such as dance, music, and theater."&lt;SEP&gt;"艺术是社会意识的一种形式，指人们通过审美活动创造的艺术作品。"</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-41183860ecf8e9826db112f1097e234e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f34069ac08b1c4bc66f348fd5d0391fa</data>
</node>
